<title>USA: Microtest sees $15.3 mln Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>Microtest sees $15.3 mln Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microtest Inc said it will take a charge of $15.3 million against fourth quarter earnings due to its Logicraft Information Systems Inc acquisition.</p>
<p>Microtest will report results on February 11.</p>
<p>Microtest paid $12.5 million in cash, paid off $4.8 million of Logicraft's intercompany debt, and incurred $900,000 in acquisition-related costs to acquire all the capital stock of Logicraft.</p>
<p>The net effect is that after Microtest records the one-time charge to earnings for the fourth quarter of 1996, the company will record $580,000 of acquired software.</p>
</text>
